@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..9Z61TIcOWOYcwgP8dIputVjKaUNd8B7fqL8Hmr2QYPo
### Регистрация
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret123",
  "displayName": "Bob"
}

### Логин
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "bob",
  "password": "supersecret123"
}

### Список диалогов
GET {{host}}/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}} 

### Создать диалог
POST {{host}}/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peerId": "b89bd75a-21b7-413b-b94d-0d7ec887d9f1"
}

### История сообщений
GET {{host}}/api/conversations/b8514512-6f00-483f-841a-785106b68e85/messages?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
